---
title: Black Bean Quesadillas
description: Crisp skillet quesadillas filled with pepper Jack, black beans, cilantro, cumin, and salsa — ready in about 20 minutes.
source: Gourmet Today, pages 299–300
author: Gourmet Magazine
servings: 4
prep time: 5 minutes
cook time: 15 minutes
time required: 20 minutes
course: main
cuisine: Mexican
tags:
